#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:7
msgid ""
"Read the Docs Business uses services from the following sub-processors to "
"provide documentation hosting services. This document supplements :doc:`our "
"Data Processing Addendum <index>` and may be separately updated on a "
"periodic basis. A sub-processor is a third party data processor who has or "
"potentially will have access to or will process personal data."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs Business 使用以下分处理方的服务来提供文档托管服务。本文档是 :doc:`我们的数据处理附录 <index>` "
"的补充，并可能定期单独更新。分处理方是指已获得或可能获得访问权限、或将处理个人数据的第三方数据处理者。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:14
msgid ""
"Previous versions of this document, as well as the change history to this "
"document, are available `on GitHub`_"
msgstr "本文档的历史版本及变更记录可在 `on GitHub`_ 查看"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:20
msgid "Infrastructure"
msgstr "基础设施"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:22
msgid "Amazon Web Services, Inc."
msgstr "Amazon Web Services, Inc."

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:23
msgid "Cloud infrastructure provider."
msgstr "云基础设施提供商。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:26
msgid "Services"
msgstr "服务"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:28
msgid "Elasticsearch B.V."
msgstr "Elasticsearch B.V."

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:29
msgid ""
"Hosted ElasticSearch services for documentation search. Search indexes do "
"not include user data."
msgstr "为文档搜索提供托管的 ElasticSearch 服务。搜索索引不包含用户数据。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:32
msgid "Sendgrid, Inc."
msgstr "Sendgrid, Inc."

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:33
msgid ""
"Provides email delivery to dashboard and admin users for site notifications "
"and other generated messages. The body of notification emails can include "
"user information, including email address."
msgstr "为仪表盘和管理员用户提供站点通知及其他生成消息的邮件投递。通知邮件正文可能包含用户信息，包括邮箱地址。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:37
msgid "Plausible"
msgstr "Plausible"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:38
msgid "Website analytics for dashboard and Read the Docs owned documentation sites."
msgstr "为仪表盘和 Read the Docs 自有文档站点提供网站分析。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:40
msgid "Stripe Inc."
msgstr "Stripe Inc."

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:41
msgid ""
"Subscription payment provider. Data collected can include user data "
"necessary to process payment transactions, however this data is not "
"processed directly by Read the Docs."
msgstr "订阅支付提供商。收集的数据可能包含处理支付交易所需的用户数据，但这些数据不由 Read the Docs 直接处理。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:46
msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "监控"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:48
msgid "New Relic"
msgstr "New Relic"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:49
msgid ""
"Application performance analytics. Data collected can include user data and "
"visitor data used within application code."
msgstr "应用性能分析。收集的数据可能包含应用代码中使用的用户数据和访客数据。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:52
msgid "Sentry"
msgstr "Sentry"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:53
msgid ""
"Error analytics service used to log and track application errors. Error "
"reports can include arguments passed to application code, which can include "
"user and visitor data."
msgstr "用于记录和跟踪应用错误的错误分析服务。错误报告可能包含传递给应用代码的参数，其中可能含有用户和访客数据。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:58
msgid "Support"
msgstr "支持"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:60
msgid "FrontApp, Inc."
msgstr "FrontApp, Inc."

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/legal/dpa/subprocessors.rst:61
msgid ""
"Customer email support service. Can have access to user data, including user"
" email and IP address, and stores communications related to user data."
msgstr "客户邮件支持服务。可访问用户数据（包括用户邮箱和 IP 地址），并存储与用户数据相关的通信记录。"

